  "Un scalaire sort avec la puissance n : det(kA) = kⁿ·det A. Puis det(AB) = det A·det B, det(Aᵀ) = det A, det(A⁻¹) = 1/det A.": "A scalar comes out with the power n: det(kA) = kⁿ·det A. Then det(AB) = det A·det B, det(Aᵀ) = det A, det(A⁻¹) = 1/det A.",
  "Si A est 3 × 3 de valeurs propres 1, 2 et 4, alors det A = 8.": "If A is 3 × 3 with eigenvalues 1, 2 and 4, then det A = 8.",
  "Vrai : det A est le produit des valeurs propres (avec multiplicités) : 1·2·4 = 8.": "True: det A is the product of the eigenvalues (with multiplicities): 1·2·4 = 8.",
  "Pour A et B carrées de même taille, det(AB) = det(BA).": "For square A and B of the same size, det(AB) = det(BA).",
  "Vrai : det(AB) = det A·det B = det B·det A = det(BA), même si AB ≠ BA.": "True: det(AB) = det A·det B = det B·det A = det(BA), even if AB ≠ BA.",
  "Si A est inversible, det(A⁻¹) = 1/det A.": "If A is invertible, det(A⁻¹) = 1/det A.",
  "Vrai : A·A⁻¹ = I donne det A·det(A⁻¹) = det I = 1.": "True: A·A⁻¹ = I gives det A·det(A⁻¹) = det I = 1.",
  "Pour toute matrice carrée A, det(Aᵀ) = −det A.": "For every square matrix A, det(Aᵀ) = −det A.",
  "Faux : det(Aᵀ) = det A. Avec A = I₂ : det(Iᵀ) = 1 ≠ −1.": "False: det(Aᵀ) = det A. With A = I₂: det(Iᵀ) = 1 ≠ −1.",
  "Pour A et B carrées de même taille, det(A + B) = det A + det B.": "For square A and B of the same size, det(A + B) = det A + det B.",
  "Faux : avec A = B = I₂, det(A + B) = det(2I₂) = 4, mais det A + det B = 2.": "False: with A = B = I₂, det(A + B) = det(2I₂) = 4, but det A + det B = 2.",
  "Pour A de taille 3 × 3, det(2A) = 2·det A.": "For A of size 3 × 3, det(2A) = 2·det A.",
  "Faux : det(2A) = 2³·det A = 8·det A. Avec A = I₃ : det(2I₃) = 8 ≠ 2.": "False: det(2A) = 2³·det A = 8·det A. With A = I₃: det(2I₃) = 8 ≠ 2.",
  "A est une matrice n × n. Que vaut det({k}A) ?": "A is an n × n matrix. What is det({k}A)?",
  "Chacune des n lignes est multipliée par {k} : det({k}A) = {k}ⁿ·det A.": "Each of the n rows is multiplied by {k}: det({k}A) = {k}ⁿ·det A.",
  "A est une matrice n × n inversible. Que vaut det(Aᵀ)·det(A⁻¹) ?": "A is an invertible n × n matrix. What is det(Aᵀ)·det(A⁻¹)?",
  "det(Aᵀ) = det A et det(A⁻¹) = 1/det A : le produit vaut 1.": "det(Aᵀ) = det A and det(A⁻¹) = 1/det A: the product is 1.",
