  "L'application x ↦ Ax, avec A = {A}, transforme la région du triangle de sommets {P}, {Q} et {R}. Calcule l'aire S de son image.": "The map x ↦ Ax, with A = {A}, transforms the triangle with vertices {P}, {Q} and {R}. Compute the area S of its image.",
