  "Cette opération ne crée pas de zéro sous le pivot : c'est la ligne du pivot qu'il faut ajouter.": "This operation does not create a zero below the pivot: it is the pivot row that must be added.",
  "Inverse A = {A} en réduisant [A | I], puis lis {b}.": "Invert A = {A} by reducing [A | I], then read {b}.",
  "Inverse A = {A} en réduisant [A | I].": "Invert A = {A} by reducing [A | I].",
  "Réduis [A | I] avec A = {A} : choisis chaque opération, puis écris la matrice. Puis donne {b}.": "Reduce [A | I] with A = {A}: choose each operation, then write the matrix. Then give {b}.",
  "Réduis [A | I] avec A = {A}. Puis donne {b}.": "Reduce [A | I] with A = {A}. Then give {b}.",
  "Calcule l'inverse de A = {A} par la formule des matrices 2 × 2.": "Compute the inverse of A = {A} with the formula for 2 × 2 matrices.",
  "ad − bc = {d} ; échanger a et d, changer le signe de b et c": "ad − bc = {d}; swap a and d, change the sign of b and c",
  "Pour une 2 × 2 : [[a, b], [c, d]]⁻¹ = (1/(ad − bc))·[[d, −b], [−c, a]].": "For a 2 × 2: [[a, b], [c, d]]⁻¹ = (1/(ad − bc))·[[d, −b], [−c, a]].",
  "Soit A = {A} et B une matrice telle que AB = I₄. Que vaut la trace de B ?": "Let A = {A} and B a matrix with AB = I₄. What is the trace of B?",
  "AB = I et A carrée : B = A⁻¹": "AB = I and A square: B = A⁻¹",
  "Somme de la diagonale": "Sum of the diagonal",
  "Soit A = {A} et B = A⁻¹. Que vaut {b} ?": "Let A = {A} and B = A⁻¹. What is {b}?",
  "Réduire [A | I]": "Reduce [A | I]",
  "Si A et B sont des matrices n × n inversibles, alors AB est inversible et (AB)⁻¹ = A⁻¹B⁻¹.": "If A and B are invertible n × n matrices, then AB is invertible and (AB)⁻¹ = A⁻¹B⁻¹.",
  "Faux : (AB)⁻¹ = B⁻¹A⁻¹, qui diffère de A⁻¹B⁻¹ dès que A et B ne commutent pas. Par exemple A = {A} et B = {B}.": "False: (AB)⁻¹ = B⁻¹A⁻¹, which differs from A⁻¹B⁻¹ as soon as A and B do not commute. For example A = {A} and B = {B}.",
  "Si A est inversible, alors Aᵀ est inversible et (Aᵀ)⁻¹ = (A⁻¹)ᵀ.": "If A is invertible, then Aᵀ is invertible and (Aᵀ)⁻¹ = (A⁻¹)ᵀ.",
  "Vrai : Aᵀ(A⁻¹)ᵀ = (A⁻¹A)ᵀ = Iᵀ = I.": "True: Aᵀ(A⁻¹)ᵀ = (A⁻¹A)ᵀ = Iᵀ = I.",
  "Si A et B sont des matrices n × n inversibles, alors (AB)⁻¹ = B⁻¹A⁻¹.": "If A and B are invertible n × n matrices, then (AB)⁻¹ = B⁻¹A⁻¹.",
  "Vrai : (AB)(B⁻¹A⁻¹) = A(BB⁻¹)A⁻¹ = AA⁻¹ = I.": "True: (AB)(B⁻¹A⁻¹) = A(BB⁻¹)A⁻¹ = AA⁻¹ = I.",
  "Si A est inversible, alors A⁻¹ est inversible et (A⁻¹)⁻¹ = A.": "If A is invertible, then A⁻¹ is invertible and (A⁻¹)⁻¹ = A.",
  "Vrai : A⁻¹A = AA⁻¹ = I dit justement que A est l'inverse de A⁻¹.": "True: A⁻¹A = AA⁻¹ = I says exactly that A is the inverse of A⁻¹.",
