  "Quel est le bloc X₁₂ de M⁻¹ ?": "What is the block X₁₂ of M⁻¹?",
  "Écris M·M⁻¹ = I bloc par bloc : A·X₁₂ + B·D⁻¹ = 0, donc X₁₂ = −A⁻¹BD⁻¹. Les blocs ne commutent pas.": "Write M·M⁻¹ = I block by block: A·X₁₂ + B·D⁻¹ = 0, so X₁₂ = −A⁻¹BD⁻¹. Blocks do not commute.",
  "On n'inverse pas une matrice par blocs case par case : A·B⁻¹ + B·D⁻¹ ≠ 0.": "A block matrix is not inverted entry by entry: A·B⁻¹ + B·D⁻¹ ≠ 0.",
  "A·X₁₂ + B·D⁻¹ = 0 donne un signe moins : X₁₂ = −A⁻¹BD⁻¹.": "A·X₁₂ + B·D⁻¹ = 0 gives a minus sign: X₁₂ = −A⁻¹BD⁻¹.",
  "Inverser le bloc A": "Invert the block A",
  "Recopier A": "Copy A",
  "M·M⁻¹ = I donne A·X₁₁ = I : X₁₁ = A⁻¹.": "M·M⁻¹ = I gives A·X₁₁ = I: X₁₁ = A⁻¹.",
  "Le bloc X₂₂ = D⁻¹.": "The block X₂₂ = D⁻¹.",
