  "Contrôle : M·M⁻¹ = I₄": "Check: M·M⁻¹ = I₄",
  "M = [[A, B], [0, D]] = {M}, avec A = {A}, B = {B} et D = {D}. Calcule M⁻¹ = [[X₁₁, X₁₂], [0, X₂₂]] par blocs.": "M = [[A, B], [0, D]] = {M}, with A = {A}, B = {B} and D = {D}. Compute M⁻¹ = [[X₁₁, X₁₂], [0, X₂₂]] by blocks.",
  "Écris M·M⁻¹ = I bloc par bloc et résous pour chaque bloc : A·X₁₁ = I, D·X₂₂ = I, A·X₁₂ + B·X₂₂ = 0.": "Write M·M⁻¹ = I block by block and solve for each block: A·X₁₁ = I, D·X₂₂ = I, A·X₁₂ + B·X₂₂ = 0.",
  "Soit M = [[I, X], [0, I]] = {M} (blocs 2 × 2). Calcule {Mk} par blocs.": "Let M = [[I, X], [0, I]] = {M} (2 × 2 blocks). Compute {Mk} by blocks.",
  "[[I, X], [0, I]]ᵏ = [[I, kX], [0, I]] : ici k = {k}": "[[I, X], [0, I]]ᵏ = [[I, kX], [0, I]]: here k = {k}",
  "Soit N = [[I, 0], [X, I]] = {N} et M = [[A, B], [0, D]] = {M} (blocs 2 × 2). Calcule NM par blocs.": "Let N = [[I, 0], [X, I]] = {N} and M = [[A, B], [0, D]] = {M} (2 × 2 blocks). Compute NM by blocks.",
  "Pour des blocs A, B, C, D de taille 2 × 2, det [[A, B], [C, D]] = det A · det D − det B · det C.": "For 2 × 2 blocks A, B, C, D, det [[A, B], [C, D]] = det A · det D − det B · det C.",
  "Faux : la formule « ad − bc » ne vaut pas pour des blocs. Par exemple {A} : la formule ne donne pas son déterminant.": "False: the « ad − bc » formula does not hold for blocks. For example {A}: the formula does not give its determinant.",
  "Pour A et D carrées, det [[A, B], [0, D]] = det A · det D.": "For square A and D, det [[A, B], [0, D]] = det A · det D.",
  "Vrai : une matrice triangulaire par blocs a pour déterminant le produit des déterminants des blocs diagonaux.": "True: a block triangular matrix has as determinant the product of the determinants of the diagonal blocks.",
  "Si A et D sont inversibles, [[A, 0], [0, D]]⁻¹ = [[A⁻¹, 0], [0, D⁻¹]].": "If A and D are invertible, [[A, 0], [0, D]]⁻¹ = [[A⁻¹, 0], [0, D⁻¹]].",
  "Vrai : le produit par blocs donne [[AA⁻¹, 0], [0, DD⁻¹]] = I.": "True: the block product gives [[AA⁻¹, 0], [0, DD⁻¹]] = I.",
  "M = [[A, B], [0, D]] avec A = {A}, B = {B} et D = {D}. Quel est le bloc (1, 2) de M⁻¹ ?": "M = [[A, B], [0, D]] with A = {A}, B = {B} and D = {D}. What is the block (1, 2) of M⁻¹?",
