  "x<sub>k</sub> = (u<sub>k+1</sub> ; u<sub>k</sub>) vérifie x<sub>k+1</sub> = Mx<sub>k</sub>. Écris M.": "x<sub>k</sub> = (u<sub>k+1</sub> ; u<sub>k</sub>) satisfies x<sub>k+1</sub> = Mx<sub>k</sub>. Write M.",
  "Ligne 1 : la récurrence ; ligne 2 : u<sub>k+1</sub> = u<sub>k+1</sub>": "Row 1: the recurrence; row 2: u<sub>k+1</sub> = u<sub>k+1</sub>",
  "Matrice compagne [[a, b], [1, 0]]": "Companion matrix [[a, b], [1, 0]]",
