  "Décompose x₀ = (u₁ ; u₀) = {x0} = c₁v₁ + c₂v₂.": "Decompose x₀ = (u₁ ; u₀) = {x0} = c₁v₁ + c₂v₂.",
  "Résoudre le système 2 × 2": "Solve the 2 × 2 system",
